# Rover 45 four-door saloon, 1999-2005.
#
# The facelifted Rover 400: 4,366 mm long, 1,695 mm wide, 1,395 mm high,
# 2,620 mm wheelbase; 1.4-2.0 petrol and 2.0 diesel, the 45 the upper-medium
# Rover of the MG Rover years. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rover_45
#
# Colours: Tahiti Blue, Zircon Silver, Nightfire Red and Arden Green are period
# Rover finishes.
#
# Weight: 100 in total (blue 30, silver 26, red 24, green 20).
#
# Speed 200 km/h; comfort 105/488 (line). Classes 0,1,2.
# Dates: 1999-2005 with a road tail to about 2016.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/rover-45.blend. References:
# citycars/references/rover-45/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

obj=citycar
name=Rover45(TahitiBlue)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=30
intro_year=1999
intro_month=10
retire_year=2016
retire_month=6
speed=200
class=0,1,2
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=105
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=488

